Package: parkeze-tui
Version: @VERSION@-@BUILD@
Depends: ucode, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-uci, parkeze-base, parkeze-console, coreutils-stty, qrencode
Source: parkeze
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: The gateway console, in a terminal.
 Every page of the web console, for a serial line, an SSH session, the USB
 serial port or a Pi's own screen. Calls the console's own ucode, so it reads
 and changes the gateway exactly as the web console does, and signs in the
 same way when it runs on a port rather than from a root shell.
 .
 coreutils-stty because OpenWrt's busybox has no stty, and raw input needs one.
